--TEST--
`#[Core\Router\Params]` in a method with no `#[Core\Router\Target]` is `E1000`: the values have no route to be checked against — `rule:routing/a-route-target-parameter-is-checked-like-a-link`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Menu {
    // `$route` takes a method, but it has no `#[Core\Router\Target]`.
    public static function entry(callable $route, #[Core\Router\Params] array $values): string {
        return "entry";
    }
}

echo "unreachable\n";
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E1000]: `#[Core\Router\Params]` is in a method with no `#[Core\Router\Target]` parameter
  --> case.nvs:4:53
